      "title": {
        "en": "Kwadrans po pierwszej"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Minutes past the hour take *po*: *pięć po ósmej* (8:05), *kwadrans po pierwszej* (1:15; a *kwadrans* is fifteen minutes). Minutes to the hour take *za*: *za pięć ósma* (7:55), *za kwadrans druga* (1:45). Half past counts towards the next hour: *wpół do drugiej* is 1:30."
      },
      "kind": "zapamietaj"
    },
    {
